      <tr><td><code>behaviors</code>, <code>submit_handler</code></td><td><code>data-behavior-when</code>, <code>data-submit-handler-when</code></td><td>no <code>&lt;form&gt;</code></td><td><a href="?p=16-comportamento-form">16</a></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>sequence</code>, <code>sequence_when</code>, <code>sequence_keep</code></td><td><code>data-sequence*</code></td><td>no <strong>controle</strong> (input/select)</td><td><a href="?p=12-sequencia">12</a></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>sequence_config</code></td><td><code>data-sequence-config</code></td><td><strong>atributo</strong> de um hidden</td><td><a href="?p=12-sequencia">12</a></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>step</code> (na seção)</td><td><code>data-step</code></td><td>na seção</td><td><a href="?p=13-wizard">13</a></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>step_config</code></td><td><code>data-step-config</code></td><td><strong>value</strong> de um hidden</td><td><a href="?p=13-wizard">13</a></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>dynamic_table</code></td><td><code>data-dynamic-table-when</code></td><td>no elemento que contém o wrapper da tabela</td><td><a href="?p=14-tabela-dinamica">14</a></td></tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="warn">
    <p>
      <strong>A armadilha do wrapper.</strong> Os plugins que alteram o input o
      encontram com <code>element.querySelector('input, select, textarea')</code>
      procuram <em>dentro</em>, nunca no próprio elemento. Atributo direto no
      <code>&lt;input&gt;</code> falha em silêncio. <code>visible_when</code> é a
      exceção (age no próprio elemento), o que torna a armadilha pior: o primeiro plugin
      que a maioria experimenta funciona nos dois lugares. <strong>Gerando do servidor,
      não acontece</strong>, o <code>FormRenderer</code> sempre acerta o lugar.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>A DSL de condições</h2>

  <h3>O que você escreve em PHP</h3>
  <pre><code>['Campo' =&gt; 'S']                                  // canônica
['Campo' =&gt; ['A', 'B', 'C']]                      // pertence a (3+ valores)
['Campo' =&gt; ['&gt;' =&gt; 100]]                         // operador
['Campo' =&gt; ['&gt;', 100]]                           // par posicional
['Campo', '&gt;', 100]                               // tripla
['field' =&gt; 'Campo', 'op' =&gt; '&gt;', 'value' =&gt; 100] // forma longa
[ $cond1, $cond2 ]                                // lista → AND implícito
['AND' =&gt; [...]], ['OR' =&gt; [...]]                 // recursivo</code></pre>
  <p>
    Apelidos de operador normalizados: <code>=</code>, <code>==</code>,
    <code>===</code> → <code>eq</code>; <code>&lt;&gt;</code>, <code>!==</code>,
    <code>neq</code>, <code>not_eq</code> → <code>!=</code>.
  </p>

  <h3>O que o runtime lê</h3>
  <div class="table-scroll">
    <table>
      <tr><th>Operador</th><th>Comparação</th></tr>
      <tr><td><code>eq</code></td><td><code>===</code> (igual à forma curta)</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>!=</code></td><td><code>!==</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>&gt;</code> <code>&lt;</code> <code>&gt;=</code> <code>&lt;=</code></td><td>numérica, via <code>parseFloat</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>regex</code></td><td><code>new RegExp(valor).test(campo)</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>eq_field</code> / <code>neq_field</code></td><td>contra outro campo; o operando é o <em>nome</em> dele</td></tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h3>Leitura dos campos</h3>
  <div class="table-scroll">
    <table>
      <tr><th>Controle</th><th>Valor lido</th></tr>
      <tr><td>texto, select simples, textarea</td><td><code>value</code> (string)</td></tr>
      <tr><td>checkbox</td><td>marcado ⇒ o <code>value</code> do campo · desmarcado ⇒ <code>"N"</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td>radio</td><td><code>value</code> do marcado, ou <code>null</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td>select multiple</td><td><strong>array</strong> de valores</td></tr>
      <tr><td>campo inexistente</td><td><code>null</code></td></tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2>Ações (<code>runActions</code>)</h2>
  <p>
    Usadas em <code>on_success</code>, <code>on_fail</code>, <code>on_empty</code>,
    <code>action</code> do <code>confirm_submit</code> e <code>success_actions</code>.
    Nos templates: <code>{Campo}</code>, <code>{value}</code>, <code>{response}</code>,
    <code>{response.a.b}</code>.
  </p>
  <div class="table-scroll">
    <table>
      <tr><th>Ação</th><th>Forma</th></tr>
      <tr><td><code>set_value</code></td><td><code>['Campo' =&gt; 'template']</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>set_options</code></td><td><code>['Campo' =&gt; [path, value_key, label_key, include_empty, value]]</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>set_html</code></td><td><code>['seletor' =&gt; 'template']</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>toggle</code></td><td><code>[selector, show]</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>toggle_by_response</code></td><td><code>[selector, path, equals|gt|gte|neq]</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>message_by_response</code></td><td><code>[path, equals, message|message_path, type]</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>show_message</code></td><td><code>[type, message]</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>clear</code></td><td><code>'Campo'</code> ou lista</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>trigger</code></td><td><code>'Campo'</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>call</code></td><td><code>['call' =&gt; 'fn', 'args' =&gt; [...]]</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>conditional</code></td><td><code>[condition, then, else]</code></td></tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2>API pública</h2>
  <pre><code>window.__formRuleEnginesByName['nomeDoForm']   // por nome, o caminho confiável
window.formVisibilityManager.engine           // o ÚLTIMO form inicializado da página

engine.refresh()                          // reavalia todas as regras
engine.addElement(el, 'visible')          // registra um elemento criado em runtime
engine.evaluateCondition(regra)           // avalia uma condição da DSL
engine.getFieldValue('Campo')             // leitura normalizada
engine.setFieldValue('Campo', v, dispararChange = true)
engine.setFieldOptions('Campo', opcoes, valueKey, labelKey, incluirVazio, selecionarPrimeira)
engine.clearField('Campo')
engine.showMessage('error', 'texto')
engine.hasRemoteValidationErrors()
engine.plugins.get('prevent-submit').validateBeforeSubmit('nomeDoForm')
engine.plugins.get('validate').registerValidator('nome', fn)

initFormVisibilityV2(raiz)                // inicializa HTML injetado depois</code></pre>

